## --- Everything build-output/local that Docker never needs to see ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/logs/
**/DataProtection-Keys/

## --- Secrets: never bake these into an image layer ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!/.env.example
**/appsettings.Development.json

## --- VCS / editor noise ---
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

## --- Non-backend stuff Docker build context doesn't need ---
*.md
tests/
docker-compose.yml
